          "source_heading": "PATIENT MONITORING",
          "canonical_heading": "PATIENT MONITORING",
          "content_blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Serial ophthalmic examinations should be performed, including fundic exam. Careful attention should be paid to visual deficits; resolution of deficits indicates improvement in disease, but may also reflect the patient’s adaptation to vision loss, making client’s reports of vision unreliable.",
